; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 28. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'mtA0_intro'
mtA0_intro.dialogstring_07E77E! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Giant mushrooms crowd the[N]summit of Mount Kehres,[N]and thick stalks twist[N]together.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_0398FC! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10]Tried using the mushroom's[N]droplets.[FIN]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_039925! `However, nothing happens![END]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_039935! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]Poured the mushroom's[N]droplets at the place[N]where the stalk ends![END]`

?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E4A4! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The creatures of this[N]sanctuary are fierce.[FIN]Let Aura Barrier turn[N]aside what thy blade[N]cannot.[FIN][RET]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08EDF2! `Aura Barrier is a Power of[N]Darkness that is only[N]usable by Freedan, the[N]Warrior of Darkness.[FIN]Thou canst create a[N]barrier composed of thy[N]aura around thee with[N]this power.[FIN]Block while charged.`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039861! `[DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][SFX:10]Tried using the Tearpot.[FIN]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_039880! `But nothing happens![END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu92_rofsky'
eu92_rofsky.dialogstring_07D764! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Rofski: Oh, that is[N]definitely the Tearpot[AD] So[N]it really does exist[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu92_erasquez'
eu92_erasquez.dialogstring_07D8D2! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Elazquez: There's[N]something in the air[N]tonight.[FIN]I think some of these[N]people have been replaced.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]It might be people[N]travelling through the[N]plaza, it might be your[N]friend, it might be me.[FIN]You should try to use the[N]Tearpot on characters that[N]you think are suspicious.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039890! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2]The tears of the gods[N]showered down![END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu95_neils_father'
eu95_neils_father.dialogstring_07E259! `[BOR:8][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1A]Moon Tribe:[N]Mweheheheheheheh…[FIN]The old powers are[N]stirring again as the[N]comet nears.[FIN][CLD][BOR:8][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1A]The people we replaced[N]are only bones in the[N]shrine basement now.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu95_neil'
eu95_neil.dialogstring_07E3F4! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: [AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]I came home after three[N]years[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]and thought I'd[N]finally understood how[N]much my parents meant to[N]me.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Now I don't even know how[N]long they've been gone.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Will[AD] Would you mind[N]leaving me alone for a[N]while?[FIN][CLD][DEF]Neil lowers his head.[N]Will has never seen him[N]like this before.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu96_neil'
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DC37! `[DEF]The next morning brings[N]unwelcome news[AD][END]`
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DC63! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Good morning.[N]Sorry for worrying you.[WAI][N]I thought all night about[N]what Reuleck has done.[WAI][N]If I walk away, someone[N]else inherits the company[N]and nothing has to change.[WAI][N]So I'm going to take it.[N]And I'm going to end our[N]part in the slave trade.[WAI][N]A company that helped[N]build that trade should[N]help tear it down.[WAI][N]There has to be a way to[N]make a living without[N]turning misery into money.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: President Neil?[N]I'd like to see Lance and[N]Lilly's faces when you[N]tell them.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Hehe. Don't make it[N]sound so grand.[END]`
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DD70! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Oh, and Kara-[N]someone came to see you.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]You've mentioned your old[N]sweetheart before.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Huh[AD]!?[END]`
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DDBF! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Hey, come in…![END]`
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DDD2! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Hamlet[AD]![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]Squee squee[AD]![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]How?! Is he alright?![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Hahaha. Apparently[N]it followed you as far as[N]Watermia.[FIN]Lilly found it there and[N]sent word. I had one of[N]Reuleck's couriers bring[N]it here.[FIN]I may be leaving the[N]road, but it looks[N]like your party keeps[N]gaining allies.[END]`
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DEAD! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Take care, everyone.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu96_erik'
eu96_erik.dialogstring_07DB09! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I don't understand[N]girls at all.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu96_neil'
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DEF9! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1]Squee squee...[END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu96_kara'
eu96_kara.dialogstring_07DA3D! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Angkor Wat is west[N]of here.[WAI][N]That's near the homeland[N]those slaves spoke about.[WAI][N]After everything we've[N]seen, I want to know what[N]happened there.[END]`
